<title>HONG KONG: Shandong Xinhua's HK offer 74 times oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Shandong Xinhua's HK offer 74 times oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Shandong Xinhua Pharmaceutical Co Ltd said in a statement on Thursday its public share offer in Hong Kong was about 74 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>The company offered 140 million H-shares this month at HK$1.82 each. H-shares are Hong Kong-listed shares of China-incorporated enterprises.</p>
<p>Dealing in the shares on the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong are expected to start on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
